::SparkSQL Parquet-files::
Which of the following command is used to create an RDD DataFrame by reading a data from the parquet file?
{
~parquet.read()
~parquet("file_name")
=sqlContext.read.parquet("file_name")
~None of the above
}

::SparkSQL Parquet-files::
If the following read command was used to read data and it was executed successfully. What should be the file format here?
spark.read.load("filename.fileformat")
{
~CSV
~JSON
~orc
=Parquet
}

